1
00:00:05,791 --> 00:00:06,875
My lady,

2
00:00:09,833 --> 00:00:11,666
this is our chance！

3
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:14,541
That idiot Livia just called
off the wedding with the Godfather!

4
00:00:15,666 --> 00:00:16,875
What?!

5
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:19,458
They think he is
just some ordinary miner.

6
00:00:19,458 --> 00:00:23,500
Livia publicly broke the engagement and
married his pathetic little brother instead!

7
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
Oh, thank the
gods for stupid women!

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,166
Send word immediately.

9
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:28,708
Prepare the most extravagant gift.

10
00:00:28,708 --> 00:00:31,208
I’m going to propose
to the Godfather myself.

11
00:00:31,333 --> 00:00:32,541
Move!

12
00:00:41,125 --> 00:00:42,291
Blade!

13
00:00:42,541 --> 00:00:43,791
You’re here!

14
00:00:44,875 --> 00:00:46,666
Who the hell hit you?

15
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:48,125
Step forward right now!

16
00:00:48,125 --> 00:00:49,291
It was him.

17
00:00:57,625 --> 00:00:59,875
You’re the one who hit Redmond?

18
00:00:59,875 --> 00:01:02,833
Get out now, or you’re next.

19
00:01:03,875 --> 00:01:05,041
What did you just say?

20
00:01:05,041 --> 00:01:06,291
You’re gonna hit me?

21
00:01:06,291 --> 00:01:06,916
You guys hear that?

22
00:01:06,916 --> 00:01:08,416
This punk says
he’s gonna hit me.

23
00:01:08,416 --> 00:01:10,291
Who the hell is this guy?

24
00:01:10,291 --> 00:01:11,416
So freaking bold?

25
00:01:11,666 --> 00:01:14,791
He’s the disowned
trash of House Carter.

26
00:01:15,250 --> 00:01:16,791
Spends all day
banging rocks with a

27
00:01:16,791 --> 00:01:18,458
bunch of lowborns in the mines.

28
00:01:19,125 --> 00:01:21,125
Just a miner, huh?

29
00:01:21,125 --> 00:01:23,083
No wonder you don’t
know who I am.

30
00:01:23,083 --> 00:01:26,500
Listen up, I'm the Blade.

31
00:01:26,500 --> 00:01:28,291
See this blood on my blade?

32
00:01:28,291 --> 00:01:29,750
That’s what I do.

33
00:01:30,500 --> 00:01:33,083
Lord Severin, I’ve heard enough.
